<title>USA: AMEX trades Wellsford &quot;when issued&quot; stock.</title>
<headline>AMEX trades Wellsford &quot;when issued&quot; stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange on Monday began &quot;when issued&quot; trading on the common stock of Wellsford Real Properties Inc.</p>
<p>Wellsford Real Properties, a New York City-based real estate investment company, was organized recently to make real estate investments through direct acquisition, rehabilitation, development, financing and management of real properties.</p>
